Package: rp1-gpclk-dkms
Version: 1.1.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Lee Bussy <lee@bussy.org>
Installed-Size: 159
Depends: dkms (>= 2.1.0.0)
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/WsprryPi/RP1-GPCLK-DKMS
Description: DKMS source for the Raspberry Pi RP1 GPCLK module
 Stock-kernel out-of-tree module providing bounded RP1 GPCLK0 control for
 WsprryPi. The package installs DKMS source and inactive GPIO4 and GPIO20
 device-tree overlays. It does not enable an overlay or load the module.
